22:40.030 --> 22:40.680
Ranran.

22:42.440 --> 22:43.030
Su Yishui.

22:43.590 --> 22:44.160
Ranran.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.310
Aku mengikuti

22:46.310 --> 22:47.510
